0 This is the chameleon's eyes: a peg gives Ian's fingers something to
0 press on, and the tile is the pupil. 98138 stays role: decorative (see
0 connections.yml), so JOINS is the only thing that would actually catch
0 a floating tile -- without it this fixture would pass even if the tile
0 sat in mid-air.
